<h3 class="run-in">USHIRO RYOTE-MOCHI KOTE-GAESHI | NẮM HAI TAY TỪ PHÍA SAU: NÉM LẬT</h3>
<h4 class="subhead">CỔ TAY (ỨNG DỤNG THỰC TẾ 1)</h4>
<figure class="fig"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/taichinow/taichinow-media/main/assets/books/aikido_total_aikido_vi/img/p147_f01.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
<figure class="fig"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/taichinow/taichinow-media/main/assets/books/aikido_total_aikido_vi/img/p147_f03.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
